{"id":"452355","name":"鲮鱼蒸蛋","author":"萌萌虾球","authorId":"10734426","desc":"","cover":"images/452355/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"罐头鲮鱼","amount":"1条"}],"sub":[{"name":"精盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"1匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋打入碗中，加精盐、胡椒粉、淀粉。","img":"images/452355/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"拌匀成蛋液。","img":"images/452355/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"缓缓倒入100ml的凉开水。","img":"images/452355/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鲮鱼切碎。","img":"images/452355/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入蛋液中。","img":"images/452355/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒸锅里加水，水开上汽后再放蛋液。","img":"images/452355/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"在碗上盖一只盘子或者覆一层保鲜膜。","img":"images/452355/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"在蒸锅中隔水蒸10分钟后熄火，加盖焖约3分钟。","img":"images/452355/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"淋少许酱油即可。","img":"images/452355/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"蒸蛋时加少许淀粉有助于蛋液凝固。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}